":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids, March to April came in under 90% of normal in 33 of those years, and so did May to June and June to July. In 2025, July to August on the middle of the grids came in at 50% of normal. So far in 2026, January to February sits at 40% of normal on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
